      "content": "Even if a clinic dismissed it, your symptoms warrant a more thorough check-up, as they can be concerning. Mixing Gatorade and salt might temporarily manage electrolyte imbalances, but it won't address underlying issues. If these symptoms persist or worsen, you need to seek a second opinion from a different healthcare provider immediately. Trust your body's signals and get it checked out again.",
      "source": "target",
